otout means sudden-death periods up to OT9. Presets: standard, four-on-four, international, overtime-then-tie, shootout-only, ties. Each game keeps a copy of its league's rules from its creation (the home team's league, else the away team's); a game without one keeps the built-in rules, exactly as earlier builds played it. A tie that stands earns a point each","learn.ja_contract":["contracts/ja/rinkvt_frame.ja","contracts/ja/rinkvt_overtime.ja"],"learn.maturity":"OPERATIONAL","learn.evidence":["tests/test_browser.py","tests/test_store.py"],"learn.scope_limit":"the engine's own test suite belongs to the reference edition (Node.js), whose 78 engine tests pass on this engine, and whose 128 other tests pass with it; this edition exercises the engine through its browser tests"},
